---
/**
 * HeroSketch — the hero's right column.
 *
 * A hand-drawn studio scene: one person seated at a desk with a pen on the
 * shared sheet, the other standing and watching, a lamp pouring light over
 * the work. Line art with real contour — profile heads, shoulders and chest
 * volume, tube arms with visible bends, mitten hands, shoes, hatched
 * shadows. The first version was stick-poses in a frame; this one had to be
 * drawn, not assembled.
 *
 * Colour appears only where a pen would have left it: the lamp's glow on the
 * paper, one highlighted line, two sparks. Decorative by contract: the
 * hero's words carry the meaning, so the drawing is hidden from assistive
 * tech.
 */
---

<svg class="hero-sketch" viewBox="0 0 640 520" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <!-- Sketchbook frame: four open strokes, each overshooting its corner. -->
  <g class="hs-mid">
    <path d="M40 34C200 26 420 28 600 36" />
    <path d="M604 26C612 180 610 340 602 484" />
    <path d="M606 490C430 498 220 496 36 488" />
    <path d="M30 482C24 340 26 180 36 26" />
  </g>

  <!-- Sparks: the only accent fills besides the lamp. Classed separately so
       the twinkle keyframes never touch the lamp bulb or the highlighted
       line, which share .hs-acid. -->
  <g class="hs-acid hs-sparks">
    <path d="M110 66c4 16 10 22 26 26-16 4-22 10-26 26-4-16-10-22-26-26 16-4 22-10 26-26Z" />
    <path d="M432 53c3 11 7 15 18 18-11 3-15 7-18 18-3-11-7-15-18-18 11-3 15-7 18-18Z" />
  </g>

